  "description": "⭐<strong><em>Banksy Limitless: Reframed</em></strong><em> is a temporary, museum-quality exhibition created exclusively for London, bringing the world of street art into a gallery setting. Reimagining the original experience, it features refreshed collections, newly added original artworks, immersive spaces, and over 250 works exploring Banksy’s iconic world.</em><br><br><strong>🚨 The exhibit is leaving London on August 31—don't miss out! 🚨 </strong><br>🧑‍🤝‍🧑&nbsp;<strong>Bring a plus-one and save 15% with the Duo Pass!&nbsp;</strong>🧑‍🤝‍🧑<br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> 🤩 Experience a one-of-a-kind Banksy exhibition created especially for London<br> 🖼️ Discover 250 artworks, from original and certified pieces to sculptures, photos, digital installations, and murals<br> ✨ Step inside the Immersive Room and experience iconic installations such as Dismaland, a new room showcasing Banksy’s UK artworks, and more<br> 🎨 Premium Tickets: Get hands-on with Banksy’s iconic style—try spray painting your own tee for a one-of-a-kind artsy experience and take home a unique souvenir<br> 🏛️ Enjoy the prestige of a central London venue, where street art meets a gallery setting<br> 🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for Banksy Limitless <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/474997\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Date: choose directly in the ticket selector<br> ⏳ Duration:80+ minutes<br> 📍 Location: 79 - 85 Old Brompton Road, SW7 3LD (Sussex Mansions)<br> 👤 Age requirement: all ages are welcome!<br> ♿ Accessibility: venue is accessible for wheelchairs<br> ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://banksylimitless.com/london/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br> 👉 For groups of 15+ people, reserve your tickets <a href=\"https://banksylimitless.com/london/#experience-groups\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br> 🎭 Add-on ticket:&nbsp;MR. PUNCH’S DAY OFF — a live puppet show inside the Dismaland Theatre! Every Saturday 11:00–19:00 &amp; Sunday 11:00–18:00.<br><br><strong>Description</strong><br> Banksy Limitless transforms London’s cultural heart into the stage for a groundbreaking exhibition of the world’s most elusive and provocative street artist. Curated by experienced producers of Banksy exhibitions, this temporary showcase presents 250 works: from certified originals and rare, one-of-a-kind pieces to large-scale installations, digital works, photos, and sculptures. Visitors can admire famous highlights such as the Infinity Room, Cinderella’s Carriage, and the Grin Reaper—plus specially reproduced works created exclusively for this London event. More than an exhibition, Banksy Limitless is a cultural encounter where the raw power of street art meets the prestige of a gallery setting. Get your tickets for Banksy Limitless in London!<br>",
